#* {{quote-journal|en|title=Angel Factory|titleurl=https://archive.org/details/dart1937will/page/n53/mode/1up|journal=The Dart: The Annual Publication of the [[w:Lycoming College|Dickinson Seminary and Junior College]] at Williamsport, Pennsylvania|volume=15|location=Williamsport, Pa.|publisher=The Williamsport Printing and Binding Company|year=1937|passage=Way and Brinton, football player and student respectively, '''donners''' of African costumes, and ministers in the making were real friends, and examples of demeanor.}}
