#* {{quote-book|en|chapter=[Election Manifestos] Communist Party of India|editor=S. L. Poplai|title=National Politics and 1957 Elections in India|location=Delhi|publisher=Metropolitan Book Co. Private Ltd.|year=1957|page=106|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/dli.bengal.10689.12442/page/n122/mode/1up|passage=Honest and veteran Congressmen who have grown grey in the service of the country very often find themselves pushed aside by these new '''donners''' of the white cap.}}
